   $q$How does Dev's suggestion help develop the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows that Dev understands the experiment better than Ines does.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It explains the true reason the music plants grew more slowly.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-evidence"},{"text":"It shows that the theme is about the importance of sunlight.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"topic-not-theme"},{"text":"It offers a tempting shortcut that Ines must choose to reject.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It offers a tempting shortcut that Ines must choose to reject.$q$, $q$Dev's idea would make the results look better, so Ines's refusal shows her choosing honesty. Ines thinks he "might be right," but she had no record of it, so it is not proven.$q$, 'draft', '619559cb-4aeb-5a94-856c-38b5c72f3ffb')
