   $q$Which choice is the best objective summary of the story?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Keoni's neighbors ruin his beautiful design by painting things he did not plan.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"},{"text":"Keoni repaints the mural at night so that it finally matches his drawing.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Keoni plans to paint a mural alone, but neighbors join in, and he comes to value their additions.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Amara, a girl of about six, paints a lopsided orange sun on a wall.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Keoni plans to paint a mural alone, but neighbors join in, and he comes to value their additions.$q$, $q$This choice covers the plan, the neighbors' help, and Keoni's change without judgment. "Ruin" and "beautiful" are opinions, and the story's ending shows Keoni does not see it that way.$q$, 'draft', '610b96a2-00a0-566e-ae29-cd3828380abe')
